# ─── Real BVD invoice data ────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Real per-driver, per-transaction financial data (who bought how much
# fuel, where, when, for how much). Git history is permanent and repo
# visibility is one misclick — this never gets committed, private repo or
# not. Unlike data/bvd/ (v1's price-sheet corpus — aggregate contract
# pricing, already committed, a separate and already-settled decision),
# nothing under data/bvd-invoices/ is ever committed, synthetic fixtures
# included — those live in backend/test/fixtures/invoices/ instead. Drop
# real invoices in data/bvd-invoices/ locally; the real-invoice describe
# blocks pick them up from there and skip automatically when absent (see
# e.g. parseInvoiceCsv.test.ts).
data/bvd-invoices/
